BTC.cpp -- BTC descriptor and verification boundary handling.

1. Clear descriptor output before early returns and preserve empty-frame plane
   indexing without dereferencing the first nonexistent point.
2. Avoid invalid reverse iteration when plane extraction returns nothing.
3. Skip triangle generation without keypoints or three configured neighbors.
4. Define empty-cloud geometric verification as zero confidence.

Every hunk has an in-source `voxelslam_bridge:` rationale. The complete file
delta is generated with `diff -U3` and applied with zero fuzz.

